"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-10-28T17:16:21Z","updated_at":"2025-10-29T18:39:09Z","closed_at":"2025-10-29T18:21:35Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112129","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112129","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112129.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112129.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-29T18:21:35Z"},"body":"(During testing I found this is part of #101340, but this is a simple and harmless change that wouldn't require a whole rewrite and has a very low chance of regressions, so I opened it anyway)\r\n\r\n> **Note**: Might conflict with #106646, which also touches the same HashMaps. As long as the proposed `property_cache` is also an `AHashMap`, it's possible to gain around 0.9% more FPS. If anything, that one has priority over this.\r\n___\r\n`ClassDB::get_property()` is one of the biggest bottlenecks in GDScript (actually, in `Variant` itself) as seen when profiling.\r\n\r\nI did a bit of experimenting by making `property_setget`, `constant_map` and `signal_map` `AHashMap` instead of `HashMap`. Tests were run on a modified version of [Gaijin's BunnyMark](https://github.com/GaijinEntertainment/godot-das/tree/master/examples/bunnymark) (stress test of many GDScript instances) in a release production build, 3 times, with the average FPS of 20 seconds written down:\r\n\r\n500 bunnies:\r\n\r\n| Build    | Lowest | Highest |\r\n|----------|--------|---------|\r\n| `master` | 2157   | 2175    |\r\n| PR       | 2320   | 2337    |\r\n\r\n1000 bunnies:\r\n\r\n| Build    | Lowest | Highest |\r\n|----------|--------|---------|\r\n| `master` | 1445   | 1446    |\r\n| PR       | 1567   | 1582    |\r\n\r\n5000 bunnies:\r\n\r\n| Build    | Lowest | Highest |\r\n|----------|--------|---------|\r\n| `master` | 311    | 312     |\r\n| PR       | 340    | 349     |\r\n\r\nOverall, FPS was increased between a minimum of 2.8%.\r\n\r\nDuring profiling on a `template_debug` build with debug symbols, `ClassDB::get_property()` almost doubled in cycles, but it was mostly caused by `MethodBindTRC::call()`, which I believe means a bottleneck removed rather than a bottleneck added.\r\n\r\nBuild sizes did not change.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112129/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112129/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}